Third-party algorithm provenance
================================

FRAUDAR (graphspot/detectors/fraudar.py)
  Implemented clean-room from the published paper alone:
  Hooi, Song, Beutel, Shah, Shin, Faloutsos. "FRAUDAR: Bounding Graph Fraud in
  the Face of Camouflage", KDD 2016.
  No existing implementation was consulted at any point; in particular the
  GPL-3.0 rgmining/fraudar source was never opened. The implementation here is
  original work under this repository's BSD-3-Clause license.
